- ✅ Linter runs without errors related to Analytics (existing unrelated linter warnings in widget file)

### Next Steps for User
To enable analytics data collection:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel Dashboard under the Analytics tab for this project
3. Analytics will start collecting data automatically after deployment

### Notes
- The build process requires Supabase environment variables to complete, but this is unrelated to Analytics configuration
